<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate 22.00 pct, 3-mo 21.88 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate 22.00 pct, 3-mo 21.88 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rate (BUBOR) fell for both one- and three-month maturities on Monday, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said.</p>
<p>The one-month rate was fixed at 22.00 percent, down from 22.04 percent. The three-month rate was fixed at 21.88 percent, down from 21.91 percent, the NBH said.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
